    "reading-passage": {
      "nodeId": "542:2485",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "📖 Reading Passage",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "📖 Reading Passage"
        },
        {
          "text": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Playground",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Playground"
        },
        {
          "text": "After School at the Playground\n\nEvery afternoon after school, the playground near our building fills with children. It is a bright, colourful space with equipment for different ages.\n\nThe younger children run straight to the sandbox to build castles and dig with small shovels. Next to the sandbox, there is a row of swings — some for toddlers with safety bars, and bigger ones for older children. My little sister always asks me to push her higher.\n\nThe climbing wall is very popular with the older children. It has coloured holds and a soft mat underneath for safety. Beside it, there is a tall slide with a ladder. The children climb up, slide down, and run back to do it again.\n\nIn the centre of the playground, there is a roundabout that spins when you push it, and a seesaw where two children sit on opposite ends and go up and down. There is also a set of monkey bars that stretches across a metal frame — only the bravest children make it to the other side.\n\nAround the edges, there are benches where parents sit and watch. A drinking fountain stands near the entrance, and there are signs reminding everyone to play safely and take turns.\n\nThe ground is covered with rubber tiles to cushion any falls. The whole area is surrounded by a low fence with a gate that keeps small children inside.\n\nThe playground is where friendships begin. Children learn to share, take turns, and help each other — all while having fun.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "After School at the Playground Every afternoon after school, the playground near our building fills with children. It is a bright, colourful space with equipment for different ages. The younger children run straight to the sandbox to build castles and dig with small shovels. Next to the sandbox, there is a row of swings — some for toddlers with safety bars, and bigger ones for older children. My little sister always asks me to push her higher. The climbing wall is very popular with the older children. It has coloured holds and a soft mat underneath for safety. Beside it, there is a tall slide with a ladder. The children climb up, slide down, and run back to do it again. In the centre of the playground, there is a roundabout that spins when you push it, and a seesaw where two children sit on opposite ends and go up and down. There is also a set of monkey bars that stretches across a metal frame — only the bravest children make it to the other side. Around the edges, there are benches where parents sit and watch. A drinking fountain stands near the entrance, and there are signs reminding everyone to play safely and take turns. The ground is covered with rubber tiles to cushion any falls. The whole area is surrounded by a low fence with a gate that keeps small children inside. The playground is where friendships begin. Children learn to share, take turns, and help each other — all while having fun."
        },
        {
          "text": "Comprehension Questions",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Comprehension Questions"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. What do younger children do in the sandbox?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. What do younger children do in the sandbox?"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. What safety feature does the climbing wall have?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. What safety feature does the climbing wall have?"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. How does the roundabout work?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. How does the roundabout work?"
        },
        {
          "text": "4. What covers the ground to prevent injuries?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. What covers the ground to prevent injuries?"
        },
        {
          "text": "5. What social skills do children learn at the playground?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. What social skills do children learn at the playground?"
        }
      ]
    },
    "idioms-phrases": {
      "nodeId": "542:2498",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases"
        },
        {
          "text": "child's play",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "child's play"
        },
        {
          "text": "something very easy to do",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "something very easy to do"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Setting up the tent was child's play — it took five minutes.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"Setting up the tent was child's play — it took five minutes.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "swing into action",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "swing into action"
        },
        {
          "text": "start doing something quickly and energetically",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "start doing something quickly and energetically"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"When the bell rang, the children swung into action.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"When the bell rang, the children swung into action.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "take turns",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "take turns"
        },
        {
          "text": "alternate, let each person have a go",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "alternate, let each person have a go"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You need to take turns on the swing — don't push in!\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"You need to take turns on the swing — don't push in!\""
        },
        {
          "text": "hang on",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "hang on"
        },
        {
          "text": "hold tightly; also: wait a moment",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "hold tightly; also: wait a moment"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Hang on to the monkey bars — don't let go!\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"Hang on to the monkey bars — don't let go!\""
        },
        {
          "text": "slide into",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "slide into"
        },
        {
          "text": "move smoothly or gradually into something",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "move smoothly or gradually into something"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He slid into the conversation without anyone noticing.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"He slid into the conversation without anyone noticing.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "go around",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "go around"
        },
        {
          "text": "spin or revolve; also: be enough for everyone",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "spin or revolve; also: be enough for everyone"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The roundabout goes around faster when you push harder.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"The roundabout goes around faster when you push harder.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "climb up / climb down",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "climb up / climb down"
        },
        {
          "text": "move upward or downward using hands and feet",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "move upward or downward using hands and feet"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"She climbed up the ladder and slid down the slide.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"She climbed up the ladder and slid down the slide.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "fall over",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "fall over"
        },
        {
          "text": "lose balance and fall to the ground",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "lose balance and fall to the ground"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He fell over while running but got up quickly.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"He fell over while running but got up quickly.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "play it safe",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "play it safe"
        },
        {
          "text": "be careful, avoid risks",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "be careful, avoid risks"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Let's play it safe and stay on the smaller climbing frame.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"Let's play it safe and stay on the smaller climbing frame.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "push someone's buttons",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "push someone's buttons"
        },
        {
